#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid ""
"At <strong>AUREA</strong>, we believe that every meal should be more than "
"just food — it should be an <span class=\"highlight\">experience</span>. Our "
"name, AUREA, meaning “golden”, reflects our commitment to creating moments "
"that are timeless, warm and unforgettable, just like the glow of Italy’s rich"
" culinary heritage."
msgstr ""
"En <strong>AUREA</strong> creemos que cada comida debe ser más que comida: "
"debe ser una <span class=\"highlight\">experiencia</span>. Nuestro nombre, "
"AUREA, que significa “dorada”, refleja nuestro compromiso de crear momentos "
"atemporales, cálidos e inolvidables, como el brillo de la rica herencia "
"culinaria de Italia."

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid ""
"Our story began with a passion for Italian cuisine and a dream to bring <span"
" class=\"highlight\">authentic flavours</span>, fresh ingredients and the "
"spirit of Italy to our community. Inspired by the artistry of traditional "
"recipes and the vibrancy of modern dining, we built AUREA to be more than a "
"restaurant — it’s a place where family, friends and good food come together."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra historia nació de la pasión por la cocina italiana y del sueño de "
"traer <span class=\"highlight\">sabores auténticos</span>, ingredientes "
"frescos y el espíritu de Italia a nuestra comunidad. Inspirados en el arte de"
" las recetas tradicionales y en la energía de la cocina moderna, creamos "
"AUREA para que fuera más que un restaurante: un lugar donde se reúnen la "
"familia, los amigos y la buena comida."

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "The Aurea experience"
msgstr "La experiencia Aurea"

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid ""
"Every detail of our space, from the warm brick walls to the elegant "
"chandeliers and greenery, is designed to transport you to a <span "
"class=\"highlight\">modern Italian oasis</span>. Whether you’re enjoying a "
"glass of wine at our marble bar or sharing a handmade pasta dish at one of "
"our tables, our goal is to create an atmosphere that feels both refined and "
"welcoming."
msgstr ""
"Cada detalle de nuestro espacio, desde las cálidas paredes de ladrillo hasta "
"las elegantes lámparas de araña y las plantas, está pensado para llevarte a "
"un <span class=\"highlight\">oasis italiano moderno</span>. Ya sea "
"disfrutando de una copa de vino en nuestra barra de mármol o compartiendo un "
"plato de pasta artesanal en una de nuestras mesas, queremos crear un ambiente"
" refinado y acogedor a la vez."

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Our philosophy"
msgstr "Nuestra filosofía"

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Authenticity"
msgstr "Autenticidad"

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Honouring the roots of Italian tradition."
msgstr "Honramos las raíces de la tradición italiana."

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Calidad"

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Using only the finest ingredients."
msgstr "Usamos solo los mejores ingredientes."

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Hospitality"
msgstr "Hospitalidad"

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Treating every guest like part of our <em>famiglia</em>."
msgstr "Tratamos a cada invitado como parte de nuestra <em>famiglia</em>."

#: templates/pages/about.html
msgid "Eat well, live well."
msgstr "Come bien, vive bien."

